@startuml tuan-tu-thiet-ke-uc07a
!include _seq.iuml
title Tuần tự thiết kế – Quản lý bạn bè, đoạn A: Gửi lời mời kết bạn

actor "Người chơi" as U
box "Client (Android)" #FFFFFF
boundary MainActivity as MA
boundary FriendActivity as FA
boundary FriendRequestAdapter as FRA
boundary FriendAdapter as FAD
control SessionDAO as SD
control PresenceFirebaseDAO as PFD
control FriendshipApiDAO as FSAD
entity Player as P
entity Friendship as F
end box
box "Server (Spring Boot)" #FFFFFF
boundary "FriendshipRestController" as FRC
control "FriendshipDAO" as FD
control "PlayerDAO" as PD
entity "Friendship" as SF
entity "Player" as SP
end box

U -> MA : nhấn Bạn bè
MA -> FA : onClick(): startActivity()
FA -> SD : onCreate(): getPlayer()
SD -> P : đóng gói Player
P --> SD : Player
SD --> FA : Player
FA -> PFD : watchOnlinePlayers()
FA -> FA : loadFriendships()
FA -> FSAD : getFriendships() {Thread}
FSAD -> FRC : GET /api/friendships?playerId={id} → getFriendships()
FRC -> FD : findByPlayer()
FD -> SF : đóng gói Friendship
SF --> FD : Friendship
FD --> FRC : List<Friendship>
FRC -> PD : getTotalPoints()
PD --> FRC : tổng điểm
FRC --> FSAD : List<Friendship> (JSON)
FSAD -> F : toFriendship(): đóng gói Friendship
F --> FSAD : Friendship
FSAD --> FA : List<Friendship>
FA -> FA : runOnUiThread(): showFriendships()
FA -> F : canAccept()
F --> FA : kết quả kiểm tra
FA -> FRA : setFriendships()
FRA --> U : hiển thị lời mời đã nhận
FA -> FAD : setFriendships()
FAD -> F : getFriend()
F --> FAD : Player
FAD --> U : hiển thị danh sách bạn bè
PFD -> PFD : onDataChange(): toPlayer()
PFD -> P : đóng gói Player
P --> PFD : Player
PFD -> FA : onPlayersChanged()
FA -> FAD : setOnlineIds()
FAD --> U : hiển thị trạng thái Online / Offline
U -> FA : nhập tên đăng nhập, nhấn Kết bạn
FA -> FSAD : onClick(): sendRequest() {Thread}
FSAD -> FRC : POST /api/friendships → sendRequest()
FRC -> PD : findById()
PD -> SP : đóng gói Player
SP --> PD : Player
PD --> FRC : Player
FRC -> PD : findByUsername()
PD -> SP : đóng gói Player
SP --> PD : Player
PD --> FRC : Player
FRC -> FD : existsBetween()
FD --> FRC : false
FRC -> SF : tạo lời mời đang chờ
SF --> FRC : Friendship
FRC -> FD : insert()
FD --> FRC : true
FRC --> FSAD : Friendship (JSON)
FSAD -> F : toFriendship(): đóng gói Friendship
F --> FSAD : Friendship
FSAD --> FA : Friendship
FA -> FAD : runOnUiThread(): setFriendships()
FAD --> U : hiển thị dòng đang chờ trả lời, thông báo đã gửi lời mời
@enduml
